<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>视频会议 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE/</link><description>Recent content in 视频会议 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 10:31:03 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tags/%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E4%BC%9A%E8%AE%AE/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>电话与视频会议：听不清、抢话、共享屏幕、掉线重连</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/work/phone-and-video-meetings/</link><pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 23:40:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Language/English/Learn/dialogue/work/phone-and-video-meetings/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇按&lt;strong&gt;通话从建立到结束&lt;/strong&gt;的顺序，拆成五个细化场景：跨州电话会的免提与挂起、六人视频会上抢话插话、共享屏幕演示出状况、掉线重连、以及会议超时收尾。这五幕要解决的都不是词汇问题，而是&lt;strong&gt;通话本身随时会掉链子&lt;/strong&gt;：听不清、抢话、画面卡住、超时，全靠几句固定说法把场面接住。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>